{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226923","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226923","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422692301:0":{"text":"どういうわけか、貴重な霊水が、突然大量に出回り始めたんだ！","source_cn":"简单来说，珍贵的恩典灵露不知道为什么突然开始泛滥了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C429B990DE08160","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422692302:0":{"text":"それを知った連中が、これで呪いは怖くないなんて言い出してね。その勢いで地上に飛び出して厄化する者もいれば、旧制度を復活させようとする者まで現れる始末さ。","source_cn":"有灵露在，民众便不再将诅咒视作威胁。有些人冲动之下去往...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19832811152EE53C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422692303:0":{"text":"それはそうと、そこの気品に満ちた美し――","source_cn":"啊，说起来，这位如此气度不凡的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FC327FC8A9A743A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422692304:0":{"text":"……客人に失礼なことを言わないでください！","source_cn":"……不要当着客人说这种失礼的话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF2624DCF2178FF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422692305:0":{"text":"ごほん……この方はユグドラシルよりいらしたエルロンです。エルロン、こちらはサロクディアのサリエ様だ。","source_cn":"咳咳，这位是来自薄暮丛林的埃隆，这是萨洛克兰的沙利叶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x051CFA9A095BA50B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1422692305":{"text":"ごほん……この方はユグドラシルよりいらしたエルロンです。エルロン、こちらはサロクディアのサリエ様だ。","source_cn":"咳咳，这位是来自薄暮丛林的埃隆，这是萨洛克兰的沙利叶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x051CFA9A095BA50B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422692306:1":{"text":"初めまして、サリエ様。あなたのお名前はかねてより聞き及んでいます。","source_cn":"沙利叶阁下，我是埃隆。你的大名在途中我已经多有耳闻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x861FD4D207C8C76F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422692307:0":{"text":"あっちゃ〜……ってことは、ボクの素晴らしき人徳や噂に、王子の肩書きまで、ぜ～んぶバレてるわけだ。","source_cn":"完蛋，想必无论是我的美德还是我的风评还是我的王子头衔都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AB379978E4C225C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422692308:0":{"text":"どれも過去の話でしょう。","source_cn":"都是些早就不存在的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC7141CD4E129566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422692309:0":{"text":"ああ、母上もろともね。","source_cn":"那还得再加上我母亲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B5912C69E8F1604","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422692310:0":{"text":"いいかげんにしてください……本題に戻りますよ。","source_cn":"——够了！说正事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC668D2395A4CA6CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422692314:0":{"text":"へえ……ユグドラシルでも色々あったようだねえ。","source_cn":"好吧，看来你们在薄暮丛林一起经历了许多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x601BFEDBE62376D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422692315:0":{"text":"いいから本題に――","source_cn":"说正事——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCB0E41A1253FDBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422692316:0":{"text":"はいはい。本題というのは、今や呪いは最重要事項じゃなくなったということさ。","source_cn":"好吧好吧。正事就是现在诅咒已经不是最紧要的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAF1BEDD71E3E116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422692317:0":{"text":"一応霊水も、まだまだ余裕はあるしね。","source_cn":"反正我们还有灵露库存，至少能维持一段时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A845639D1830691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422692318:0":{"text":"ですが、やっと呪いが――","source_cn":"可是，诅咒马上就能——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF42D22458772484B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422692319:0":{"text":"呪いを解くのは始まりにすぎないよ、インドラ。本当に大変なのは、みんなの心の枷を外すことだ。","source_cn":"解除诅咒只是第一步，因度厄。真正的挑战在于解开人心的束缚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C02A7E6321BCDD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422692320:0":{"text":"エクシルたちは、二千年以上も地下の暮らしと呪いに縛られてきたんだ。思考や習慣、恐怖までもが、骨の髄まで染みついてしまっている。","source_cn":"艾塞勒们已经被地底的生活和诅咒束缚了两千年，思想、习惯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF84AD4E8F2D455C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422692321:0":{"text":"たとえ明日、みんなの呪いが消えたとして、すぐに新しい生活になじめると思うかい？","source_cn":"即使明天诅咒消失，你认为所有人都能立即适应新的生活吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0A572098C5181A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422692322:0":{"text":"太陽の光は、暗闇に慣れた目には眩しすぎるし、自由は、束縛に慣れた心を惑わすだろう。","source_cn":"阳光会灼伤习惯了黑暗的眼睛，自由会迷惑习惯了限制的心灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBE60B8947F0EB14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422692323:0":{"text":"サリエ様の言葉はもっともだと思います。体の呪いを解くのは簡単でも、心の縛りを解くには時間が必要です。","source_cn":"沙利叶阁下说得有道理。解除身体的诅咒容易，解除心灵的禁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x506BE3B018